* Defined token table
* Data part of element is:
*    string : 0ssssss
*    number : 1nnnnnn
*    matref : 2name index1 index2
*    char(n): 3n
*    var    : 4name
*    @var   : 5name (excluding @ character)
*    dfield : 6name fieldno subno valueno (dynamic var ref) gdw001
